complete branch-unit E/branch gate touches, joined to the route sidecar R.
preserved predicate: the zero-edge currentless row has a local
mirror-unit singleton-current certificate or is the named random031
hard/currentless control.
destroyed if scalarized: exact interval mirror, branch orientation,
component owner labels, and whether a cover-delta minimum still has a
larger complete unit-delta touch.

