## Lemma Target
Finite audited form:
  Each of the six small-touch/no-hard zero-edge rows has every dead
  singleton component completely touched by a branch-unit E/branch gate.
  The 14 components assemble into 7 mirror pairs, and every pair has at
  least one mirror-compatible branch-unit gate pair with swapped B0/B1
  owner labels.
  Rows random_covering_039 and random_covering_074 still have cover-delta
  absolute minimum gates, but the component-level certificate finds a
  complete branch-unit mirror pair, so they need not remain separate
  terminal debt if the mirror-singleton lemma is proved.
  The control row random_covering_031 has zero branch-unit complete
  singleton components and remains exactly the hard/currentless gluing
  clause from HYP-3455/HYP-3460/HYP-3479.
Proof pull:
  Prove a finite mirror-unit singleton-current lemma over swapped
  singleton B0/B1 owner pairs, carrying route sidecar R and the owner
  residue/two-adic word.  Then the non-AP currentless random frontier
  reduces to that lemma plus the named random031 hard-control clause.

